      "writtenOn": "2019-10-16T23:08:51Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "is it possible to make this decision based on the audio_policy_configuration.xml file instead?\nIf not module has an output profile with PRIMARY flag set, then primary device should not be tested",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 239,
        "startChar": 0,
